R2RPC attribution notice
=========================

R2RPC is a distributed reimplementation of the device RPC relay project
manyuegong33/r0rpc:

https://github.com/manyuegong33/r0rpc

R2RPC redesigns the server architecture, persistence, distributed connection
coordination, authorization, observability, management console, SDKs and
container deployment. The upstream repository remains the historical origin
of the project goal and must remain credited in redistributed project
documentation.

As of 2026-07-25, neither the upstream repository nor R2RPC declared an
open-source license. See LICENSE for the current repository permission notice.
